<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My World | Rishil</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  background: #111318;
  color: white;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
}

.welcome {
  border: 3px solid #168cff;
  color: #45b4ff;
  padding: 15px;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 15px #168cff;
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
}

h1 {
  margin-top: 65px;
  font-size: clamp(45px, 10vw, 85px);
  color: #5be0ff;
  text-shadow: 5px 5px #1769a5;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #aaa;
  margin: 20px 0 40px;
  font-size: 18px;
}

.container {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
}

.card {
  background: #1c222c;
  border: 2px solid #34495e;
  padding: 30px 20px;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px #080a0d;
}

.card h2 {
  color: #5be0ff;
  margin: 15px 0;
}

.card p {
  color: #bbb;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.profile {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 30px auto;
  padding: 30px;
  border: 2px solid #168cff;
  background: #191f29;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px #080a0d;
}

.profile h2 {
  color: #5be0ff;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.profile h3 {
  font-size: 27px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

footer {
  color: #777;
  margin-top: 45px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
  body { padding: 15px; }
  h1 { margin-top: 45px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="welcome">WELCOME</div>

<h1>MY WORLD</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
Welcome to my world of Technology, Creativity and Gaming.
</p>

<div class="container">

  <div class="card">
    <h2>💻 Technology</h2>
    <p>Interested in technology, computers and digital innovation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>✨ Creator</h2>
    <p>Learning new things and creating something unique.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🎮 Gaming</h2>
    <p>Gaming, exploring new worlds and having fun.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="profile">
  <h2>PLAYER PROFILE</h2>
  <h3>Muhammed RISHIL KP</h3>
  <p>Malappuram, Kerala</p>
</div>

<footer>
  © 2026 MY WORLD | Created by Rishil
</footer>

</body>
</html>
